# Semantic naming (contracts)

Before adding or renaming a cross-boundary concept, **Read and follow** [`.cursor/skills/semantic-naming/SKILL.md`](../skills/semantic-naming/SKILL.md).

Applies to: Prisma/EF models, enums, commands, domain events, `@binexus/types`, SDK methods, HTTP routes, DTOs, C# Application contracts.
